grad-fellowships.html: 21 annually recurring predoctoral awards open to
biomedical PhD and MD/PhD students, with deadlines computed live from each
programme's recurring pattern, plus sections for awards applied to before
the defence, nomination-routed prizes, travel and professional-development
awards, awards frequently mistaken for graduate mechanisms, and the
discontinued or dormant ones.

grad-project-ideas.html: 12 research themes and 36 project directions drawn
from the departmental lab profiles, each tagged with the awards that fit it
and framed around what an F31 training plan is scored on.

Nav on the four existing pages gains a Grad fellowships link.

Terms verified against sponsors' own pages on 22 September 2026.

