+    <h2>Frequently mistaken for graduate awards</h2>
+    <p class="lede">All of these require a conferred doctorate, an independent appointment, or a degree
+      programme you are not in. They are worth knowing anyway &mdash; most are the awards to apply for in the
+      first years after the PhD, and three of them are the reason the section above this one exists.</p>
