+  <span class="titles">
+    <h1>Graduate Project Ideas</h1>
+    <p>Starting points for thesis directions and predoctoral fellowship applications, built from the research profiles of the Department of Microbiology &mdash; NYU Grossman School of Medicine</p>
+  </span>
+</header>
+
+<nav>
+  <a href="./">Faculty grants</a>
+  <a href="fellowships.html">Postdoc fellowships</a>
+  <a href="grad-fellowships.html">Grad fellowships</a>
+  <a href="#top" class="here">Project ideas</a>
+  <a href="faculty-profiles.html">Faculty profiles</a>
